<translate>
==== RemoveUnhappinessWhenCooked ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for food. If the parameter is true, then after cooking the item will not give unhappiness.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
RemoveUnhappinessWhenCooked = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

